## Exact production entrypoints exercised

Each pricing variant recorded this exact sequence once:

1. `agent_loop._dispatch_pit_optimizer_v3`
2. `agent_loop._build_pit_optimizer_v3_live_run`
3. `core.pit_optimization.run_pit_optimizer_v3`

The public `core.pit_optimization.run_pit_optimizer_v3` adapter was wrapped only to record entry and immediately invoked its original implementation. The live run was built by `_build_pit_optimizer_v3_live_run`; its returned production services were thinly traced and then called unchanged.

Preparation used the active provider-free `core.pit_optimization.prepare_pit_optimizer_v3` adapter to create authenticated readiness.

